<h3>2026-11-12 — Plan: AI provider power-source data (todo #2742)</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> New plan page for storing how AI providers and their data centers get power, so AI spend can favour cleaner options.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Plan.</strong> Four new Ency Result files (<code>ai_providers</code>, <code>ai_sites</code>, <code>ai_power_sources</code>, <code>ai_energy_metrics</code>), tables created only via schema compare, seed rows only from cited sources. Includes AI editor prompts, router handoff and a Hermes fix-prompt template. No code, Result files or database changes in this entry.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>root/Documentation/AiPowerSourcesPlan.tt</code>, this changelog fragment.</p>
